@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title HydroSentinel prototype: Activity Diagram, report to resolution

|Citizen|
start
:Choose province, WSA, issue type;
:Describe problem, pin location, add photos;
:Submit report;
|System|
if (Valid input and WSA exists?) then (no)
  :Return 422 or 404;
  |Citizen|
  :See error message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|System|
:Save report, keep image files only,\ncreate reference code;
:Check volume spike and geographic cluster alerts;
|AI (GPT-4o)|
:Write acknowledgement for the citizen;
|Citizen|
:See reference code and AI reply;
|Admin|
:Sign in;
|System|
if (Valid admin token?) then (no)
  :Return 401;
  |Admin|
  :Sign in again;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Admin|
:Open report, set status to "in review", add note;
|System|
:Record reviewer and time, write audit row;
|Admin|
:Run risk score for the WSA;
|XGBoost model|
:Predict low, medium or high with confidence;
|System|
if (Model loaded, Blue Drop score present,\nconfidence at least 0.5?) then (yes)
  :Use XGBoost result;
else (no)
  :Use heuristic fallback;
endif
:Save score history, raise high-risk alert if needed;
|Admin|
:Click Draft CAP;
|System|
if (Under 20 AI requests per hour?) then (no)
  :Return 429;
  |Admin|
  :See rate-limit message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|AI (GPT-4o)|
:Draft 3 to 5 CAP items;
|Admin|
if (Accept an item?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Update CAP status and due date, write audit row;
else (no)
endif
|Admin|
:Set report to "resolved";
|Citizen|
:Track report, see "resolved";
stop
@enduml
